{
  "$comment": "Chart cases for evals/visualize-compare.eval.ts. The 10 table fixtures from fixtures/tables.json are added to these. expect.chart false means no chart is the right answer. kinds: charts that fit. x: the column the axis should use (null: any, e.g. when the model names the columns). measures: the numeric columns that may be plotted; single: plot exactly one (mixed scales). order: data means the rows' order matters (bars must not be re-sorted).",
